{
  "schema": "cablesim.plugin/2",
  "id": "cablesim.native-reference",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "name": "有限元与线源参考",
  "description": "支持单回路直埋领域文档的有限元、电热耦合与线源校核，需要明确材料参数和原生环境。",
  "icon": "assets/icon.svg",
  "publisher": {
    "id": "cablesim",
    "name": "CableSimPro"
  },
  "host_api": {
    "major": 2,
    "min_minor": 1
  },
  "license": {
    "spdx": "LicenseRef-Project-Undeclared",
    "review_required": true
  },
  "platforms": [
    "windows-x64",
    "linux-x64"
  ],
  "runtime": {
    "kind": "python",
    "python": ">=3.11,<3.14",
    "entry": "src/cablesim_native/main.py"
  },
  "permissions": [
    "project.read",
    "study.run",
    "artifact.write"
  ],
  "dependencies": [],
  "resources": {
    "timeout_s": 300,
    "memory_mb": 4096,
    "network": "none"
  },
  "capabilities": [
    {
      "kind": "method",
      "id": "fixed-power",
      "title": "直埋有限元温度",
      "method_version": "native-reference/0.1.0",
      "analysis": "steady_state",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.native-input/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "conductor_temperature",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "cable",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.native-bundle",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "unverified",
        "cases": []
      },
      "limitations": [
        "固定功率温度参考研究，不反求载流量；有限元网格要求电缆之间存在间隙。",
        "接受 v0 或 SI 领域输入；仅支持以 x=0 为中心的六层单芯三相平排或等边品字形直埋，不支持多回路、排管或时变边界。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "method",
      "id": "electrothermal",
      "title": "直埋电热耦合",
      "method_version": "native-reference/0.1.0",
      "analysis": "steady_state",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.native-input/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "ampacity",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "circuit",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "losses.conductor",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "cable",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "losses.sheath",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "cable",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "losses.dielectric",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "cable",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "conductor_temperature",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "cable",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.native-bundle",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "unverified",
        "cases": []
      },
      "limitations": [
        "显式系数损耗与线性电阻温变的有限元参考；支持运行温度和载流量反求，不等于完整 IEC 或电磁场求解。电缆之间须存在间隙。",
        "接受 v0 或 SI 领域输入；仅支持以 x=0 为中心的六层单芯三相平排或等边品字形直埋，不支持多回路、排管或时变边界。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "method",
      "id": "line-source",
      "title": "线源交叉校核",
      "method_version": "native-reference/0.1.0",
      "analysis": "crosscheck",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.native-input/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "conductor_temperature",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "cable",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.native-bundle",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "unverified",
        "cases": []
      },
      "limitations": [
        "范围限定的参考研究；固定功率温度不等于载流量。",
        "接受 v0 或 SI 领域输入；仅支持以 x=0 为中心的六层单芯三相平排或等边品字形直埋，不支持多回路、排管或时变边界。"
      ]
    }
  ],
